        "originalHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<!-- BUG 6: Missing lang attribute on html, missing main and nav landmarks, and h4 directly after h1 -->\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Brew &amp; Bean Weekly</title>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n      background: #f7f9fa;\n      color: #1a202c;\n      padding: 0 0 60px 0;\n    }\n    .promo-banner {\n      background: #e2e8f0;\n      color: #334155;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .banner-close {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      padding: 4px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .banner-close svg {\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 18px;\n      stroke: #475569;\n    }\n    .header-bar {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n      padding: 16px 24px;\n    }\n    .brand {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: #7c2d12;\n    }\n    .container {\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 40px auto 0 auto;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    }\n    .hero-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 220px;\n      background: #fed7aa;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .hero-container img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      object-fit: cover;\n    }\n    .content {\n      padding: 32px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 26px;\n      color: #27272a;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    h4 {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: #71717a;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .form-group {\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    input[type=\"email\"] {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 12px 14px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    input[type=\"email\"]:focus {\n      border-color: #9a3412;\n    }\n    /* BUG 4: Helper paragraph in light grey #aaa on white background (contrast ~2.3:1) */\n    .helper-text {\n      color: #aaa;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    /* BUG 5: Subscribe control is a div with onclick, not focusable, outline:none */\n    .btn-subscribe {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: #9a3412;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      user-select: none;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    .btn-subscribe:hover {\n      background: #7c2d12;\n    }\n    .success-message {\n      display: none;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      background: #ecfdf5;\n      color: #065f46;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"promoBanner\" class=\"promo-banner\">\n    <span>Special edition: The Ethiopian Yirgacheffe Guide is out!</span>\n    <!-- BUG 2: A nameless icon-only button (an SVG \"X\" with no aria-label or text) that closes a promo banner. Placed before the form in tab order -->\n    <button class=\"banner-close\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('promoBanner').style.display='none'\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n        <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">Brew &amp; Bean</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"hero-container\">\n      <!-- BUG 1: Hero img with no alt attribute -->\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='600' height='220' viewBox='0 0 600 220'><rect width='600' height='220' fill='%23fed7aa'/><circle cx='300' cy='110' r='60' fill='%239a3412'/><path d='M280 85 C280 75 320 75 320 85 C320 95 280 100 280 110' stroke='%23ffffff' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M260 110 C260 145 340 145 340 110 Z' fill='%23ffffff'/></svg>\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>Brew &amp; Bean Weekly</h1>\n      <!-- BUG 6 continued: h4 straight after h1, skipping h2 and h3 -->\n      <h4>Your artisanal roast digest delivered every Monday</h4>\n\n      <div class=\"newsletter-form\">\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <!-- BUG 3: Email input with no label, only a placeholder -->\n          <input type=\"email\" id=\"emailInput\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\">\n          <!-- BUG 4 continued: helper paragraph in light grey #aaa on white background -->\n          <p class=\"helper-text\">We curate stories, never spam. Unsubscribe anytime with one click.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- BUG 5 continued: real Subscribe control is a div with onclick, not focusable, outline:none in CSS -->\n        <div class=\"btn-subscribe\" onclick=\"handleSubscribe()\">\n          Subscribe\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"statusMessage\" class=\"success-message\">\n        Thanks for subscribing\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    function handleSubscribe() {\n      const email = document.getElementById('emailInput').value.trim();\n      const status = document.getElementById('statusMessage');\n      status.textContent = 'Thanks for subscribing';\n      status.style.display = 'block';\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
        "patchedHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html><!-- BUG 6: Missing lang attribute on html, missing main and nav landmarks, and h4 directly after h1 --><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Brew &amp; Bean Weekly</title>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body {\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n      background: #f7f9fa;\n      color: #1a202c;\n      padding: 0 0 60px 0;\n    }\n    .promo-banner {\n      background: #e2e8f0;\n      color: #334155;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .banner-close {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      padding: 4px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .banner-close svg {\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 18px;\n      stroke: #475569;\n    }\n    .header-bar {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n      padding: 16px 24px;\n    }\n    .brand {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: #7c2d12;\n    }\n    .container {\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: 40px auto 0 auto;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    }\n    .hero-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 220px;\n      background: #fed7aa;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .hero-container img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      object-fit: cover;\n    }\n    .content {\n      padding: 32px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 26px;\n      color: #27272a;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    h4 {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: #71717a;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .form-group {\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    input[type=\"email\"] {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 12px 14px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    input[type=\"email\"]:focus {\n      border-color: #9a3412;\n    }\n    /* BUG 4: Helper paragraph in light grey #aaa on white background (contrast ~2.3:1) */\n    .helper-text {\n      color: #aaa;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n    /* BUG 5: Subscribe control is a div with onclick, not focusable, outline:none */\n    .btn-subscribe {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 100%;\n      text-align: center;\n      background: #9a3412;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      user-select: none;\n      outline: none;\n    }\n    .btn-subscribe:hover {\n      background: #7c2d12;\n    }\n    .success-message {\n      display: none;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      background: #ecfdf5;\n      color: #065f46;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n  </style>\n<style id=\"accessfix-focus-styles\">\n:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #1a5fb4 !important; outline-offset: 2px !important; }\n</style><style id=\"accessfix-style-rules\">\n.helper-text { color: #747474 !important; }\n</style></head>\n<body>\n  <aside id=\"promoBanner\" class=\"promo-banner\">\n    <span>Special edition: The Ethiopian Yirgacheffe Guide is out!</span>\n    <!-- BUG 2: A nameless icon-only button (an SVG \"X\" with no aria-label or text) that closes a promo banner. Placed before the form in tab order -->\n    <button class=\"banner-close\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('promoBanner').style.display='none'\" aria-label=\"Close promo banner\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n        <line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </aside>\n\n  <header class=\"header-bar\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">Brew &amp; Bean</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"hero-container\">\n      <!-- BUG 1: Hero img with no alt attribute -->\n      <img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='600' height='220' viewBox='0 0 600 220'><rect width='600' height='220' fill='%23fed7aa'/><circle cx='300' cy='110' r='60' fill='%239a3412'/><path d='M280 85 C280 75 320 75 320 85 C320 95 280 100 280 110' stroke='%23ffffff' stroke-width='4' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M260 110 C260 145 340 145 340 110 Z' fill='%23ffffff'/></svg>\" alt=\"Fresh cup of artisanal coffee with rising steam on warm background\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>Brew &amp; Bean Weekly</h1>\n      <!-- BUG 6 continued: h4 straight after h1, skipping h2 and h3 -->\n      <h2>Your artisanal roast digest delivered every Monday</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"newsletter-form\">\n        <div class=\"form-group\">\n          <!-- BUG 3: Email input with no label, only a placeholder -->\n          <label for=\"emailInput\" class=\"form-label\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:#27272a;\">Email address</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"emailInput\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\">\n          <!-- BUG 4 continued: helper paragraph in light grey #aaa on white background -->\n          <p class=\"helper-text\">We curate stories, never spam. Unsubscribe anytime with one click.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- BUG 5 continued: real Subscribe control is a div with onclick, not focusable, outline:none in CSS -->\n        <button class=\"btn-subscribe\" onclick=\"handleSubscribe()\" type=\"button\">\n          Subscribe\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div id=\"statusMessage\" class=\"success-message\">\n        Thanks for subscribing\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    function handleSubscribe() {\n      const email = document.getElementById('emailInput').value.trim();\n      const status = document.getElementById('statusMessage');\n      status.textContent = 'Thanks for subscribing';\n      status.style.display = 'block';\n    }\n  </script>\n\n\n</body></html>"
